# Deny everything, allow back only what the image needs: _raw_receipts/, credentials.json,
# token.json, .env, data/ and runs/ can then never end up in an image layer
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!config/
!examples/
!docs/sample_report.html
# Bytecode, and the allowlist (real sender addresses once `allowlist add` runs);
# the container demos use examples/demo_inbox/allowlist.yaml
**/__pycache__
config/allowlist.yaml
